==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''curfew'''

# A [[regulation]] requiring people to be off the [[street]]s and in their [[home]]s by a certain [[time]].
# The time that this restriction [[begin]]s.
# A [[signal]] indicating this time.

